        \item Net Area: 5,859.82 units
        \item Total: 21,321.29 units with a 38\% net/cell ratio indicating reasonable routing
    \end{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Instance Statistics}:
    \begin{itemize}
        \item 1,295 sequential cells (29.2\% of total) - appropriate for microcontroller designs
        \item Maximum fanout of 1,150 on \texttt{clk}, properly buffered without skew issues
